    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vădo</span></b> , āre,
			v. a.
		vadum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to wade through</i>, <i>ford</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumina, quae sine pontibus vadari nequeunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 2, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quia neque navium copia pro tempore erat, neque
					vadari fluvius poterat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sulp. Sev. Chron. 1, 22, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
